# Response headers for lyniago.com (Cloudflare Workers static assets; this file is parsed, never served).
# The handoff README ("Deploy" §4-5) sets the caching rules. Content types come from the file
# extension (wrangler): .webp image/webp, .woff2 font/woff2, .svg image/svg+xml. Cloudflare's edge
# compresses HTML and SVG with brotli or gzip.
#
# script-src lists the sha256 of every inline <script> on the site's pages. scripts/check-website.mjs
# fails CI when a hash is stale, and `node scripts/check-website.mjs --write` rewrites them.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-0taCsk31BKbm7ooJY6AVQBkl+pPWJChbRw7ZAaC9nE0=' 'sha256-4gmyRTycR2nHZRUq2oSgl+kTuPEvIo2WyKOw4+q7gnM=' 'sha256-uvuHL9sVYr04KvtQCqjh8JGaBEbGxXXnoLS/4If6HfY='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Pages: always revalidate, so a deploy is visible on the next visit.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Assets: cached for a year and never revalidated. A changed asset MUST get a new file name;
# check-website.mjs fails any PR that edits a file under site/assets/ in place.
#
# One exact rule per file, never a wildcard: _headers matches by path, not by status, so `/assets/*`
# also stamped the one-year immutable header on the 404 page served at a MISSING path, and Cloudflare's
# edge cached that 404 for a year (2026-10-15: a just-deployed asset requested at an edge location
# that still had the previous version). A missing path now matches no cache rule, so it is never
# cached as immutable (docs/WEBSITE.md § Hosting). check-website.mjs fails CI when this list does not
# match site/assets/, and `node scripts/check-website.mjs --write` regenerates it.
# BEGIN immutable assets
